{"turn_id": "d26-t1", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "eval_scope", "text": "评估在系统外进行：评估了上下文外问题以及共指消解模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_metrics", "text": "在Bench'It数据集（150道法语通识开放问题）上，系统报告了宏平均精确率、召回率和F-1。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_scores", "text": "宏平均精确率、召回率和F-1分别为64.14%、64.33%和63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_metrics", "text": "在CALOR测试集上评估共指消解模型，报告平均精确率、召回率和F-1。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_scores", "text": "共指消解的平均精确率、召回率和F-1分别为65.59%、48.86%和55.77%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "english_f1", "text": "同一模型在英语上达到平均F-1为68.8%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d26-t2", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "eval_scope", "text": "论文指出，对各组件的评估是在本工作范围之外进行的；作者评估了脱离上下文的问题（out-of-context questions）以及指代消解模块（coreference resolution module）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "dataset_benchit", "text": "脱离上下文问题的性能是在 Bench'It 上评估的，该数据集包含 150 个法语通用知识开放式问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "metrics_benchit", "text": "在 Bench'It 上的评估使用 macro precision、recall 和 F-1 三项指标，分别为 64.14%、64.33% 和 63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "dataset_calor", "text": "指代消解模型在 CALOR 的测试集（test-set）上进行了评估。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "metrics_calor", "text": "在 CALOR 测试集上，指代消解模型达到平均 precision、recall 和 F-1 分别为 65.59%、48.86% 和 55.77%；同一模型在英文上达到平均 F-1 68.8%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
